            %p
              %strong Abstract
              This entry discusses the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/descent+spectral+sequence"} descent spectral sequence
              and sheaves in homotopy theory. Using said spectral sequence we compute
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi π
                        %mo *
                      %msub
                        %mi tmf
                        %mrow
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                          %mn 3
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \pi_* tmf_{(3)}
          .standout
            %p This is a sub-entry of
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology
            %p see there for background and context.
          %p Here are the entries on the previous sessions:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+cohomology+theories"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - cohomology theories
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+formal+groups+and+cohomology"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - formal groups and cohomology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+E-infinity+rings+and+derived+schemes"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - E-infinity rings and derived schemes
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+elliptic+curves"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - elliptic curves
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+equivariant+cohomology"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - equivariant cohomology
            %li
